2. The `installThenRelaunch()` function - logic check

Looking at service.ts:
```ts
async retry() {
  if (snapshot.installed) {
    await installThenRelaunch();
    return;
  }
  if (downloaded && handle && snapshot.error) {
    try {
      emit({ type: "install-started" });
      await handle.install();
      emit({ type: "installed" });
      return;
    } catch (error) {
      emit({
